# Copy to `.env` (same directory, gitignored, never committed) and fill in
# real values. The collector loads `.env` automatically on every run;
# exported variables override it. Fail-fast states: CONFIG_OK,
# MISSING_REQUIRED_CONFIG (exit 2, no polling), SKIPPED_OPTIONAL_CONFIG
# (per-source heartbeat, never a failure).
#
# MIRO_CONTACT: required. Identification in the EDGAR User-Agent.
# FRED_API_KEY: optional. Leave empty to keep FRED as SKIPPED_CONFIG.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY: optional. Live model provider key (JEV sidecar
# consumes it; absent means jev_error:no-key HOLD, never a crash).
# Fill ONLY when human authorizes live provider evidence work.
# Do not add broker/BEA keys until a code path consumes them.

# Required for P1.4 soak: SEC fair-access identification in the EDGAR User-Agent.
# Use a real reachable contact or EDGAR may return HTTP 403.
MIRO_CONTACT=your-name@example.com

# Optional: FRED collector. Leave empty to keep FRED as SKIPPED_CONFIG (expected).
FRED_API_KEY=

# Optional: OpenRouter provider key. Leave empty until live model
# evidence is human-authorized (absent = HOLD, never a crash).
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
